            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1688] Each new paragraph of a notebook takes 25-30 second to build a fresh jdbc connection . </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1688</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I am using zeppelin 6 for connecting to hive via jdbc connection . My each paragraph would take around 20-30 second to connect to jdbc client and fetch the result .This is becoming a performance issue . Please suggest if there is any way out to reduce this time frame or which parameters are responsible for this timing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
